  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      { "type": "notice", "text": "注意事项：1. 答卷前，考生务必将自己的姓名、准考证号填写在答题卡上。2. 回答选择题时，选出每小题答案后，用铅笔把答题卡上对应题目的答案标号涂黑。如需改动，用橡皮擦干净后，再选涂其他答案标号。回答非选择题时，将答案写在答题卡上，写在本试卷上无效。3. 考试结束后，将本试卷和答题卡一并交回。" },
      { "type": "partHeading", "partId": "part-2024-jslk-listening", "text": "第一部分 听力(共两节，满分30分)" },
      { "type": "instruction", "text": "做题时，先将答案标在试卷上。录音内容结束后，你将有两分钟的时间将试卷上的答案转涂到答题卡上。" },
      { "type": "sectionHeading", "sectionId": "section-2024-jslk-listening-1", "text": "第一节 (共5小题；每小题1.5分，满分7.5分)" },
      { "type": "instruction", "text": "听下面5段对话。每段对话后有一个小题，从题中所给的A、B、C三个选项中选出最佳选项。听完每段对话后，你都有10秒钟的时间来回答有关小题和阅读下一小题。每段对话仅读一遍。" },
      { "type": "exampleQuestion", "text": "例：How much is the shirt? A.£19.15. B.£9.18. C.£9.15 答案是C。" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-listening-s1" },
      { "type": "sectionHeading", "sectionId": "section-2024-jslk-listening-2", "text": "第二节(共15小题；每小题1.5分，满分22.5分)" },
      { "type": "instruction", "text": "听下面5段对话或独白。每段对话或独白后有几个小题，从题中所给的A、B、C三个选项中选出最佳选项。听每段对话或独白前，你将有时间阅读各个小题，每小题5秒钟；听完后，各小题给出5秒钟的作答时间。每段对话或独白读两遍。" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-listening-m6" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-listening-m7" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-listening-m8" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-listening-m9" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-listening-m10" },
      { "type": "pageBreakHint" },

      { "type": "partHeading", "partId": "part-2024-jslk-reading", "text": "第二部分 阅读(共两节，满分50分)" },
      { "type": "sectionHeading", "sectionId": "section-2024-jslk-reading-choice", "text": "第一节 (共15小题；每小题2.5分，满分37.5分)" },
      { "type": "instruction", "text": "阅读下列短文，从每题所给的A、B、C、D四个选项中选出最佳选项。" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-reading-a" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-reading-b" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-reading-c" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-reading-d" },
      { "type": "sectionHeading", "sectionId": "section-2024-jslk-reading-seven", "text": "第二节 (共5小题；每小题2.5分，满分12.5分)" },
      { "type": "instruction", "text": "阅读下面短文，从短文后的选项中选出可以填入空白处的最佳选项。选项中有两项为多余选项。" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-seven-choices" },
      { "type": "pageBreakHint" },
      { "type": "partHeading", "partId": "part-2024-jslk-language", "text": "第三部分 语言运用(共两节，满分30分)" },
      { "type": "sectionHeading", "sectionId": "section-2024-jslk-cloze", "text": "第一节(共15小题；每小题1分，满分15分)" },
      { "type": "instruction", "text": "阅读下面短文，从每题所给的A、B、C、D四个选项中选出最佳选项。" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-cloze" },
      { "type": "sectionHeading", "sectionId": "section-2024-jslk-grammar", "text": "第二节 (共10小题；每小题1.5分，满分15分)" },
      { "type": "instruction", "text": "阅读下面短文，在空白处填入1个适当的单词或括号内单词的正确形式。" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-grammar-fill" },
      { "type": "pageBreakHint" },
      { "type": "partHeading", "partId": "part-2024-jslk-writing", "text": "第四部分 写作(共两节，满分40分)" },
      { "type": "sectionHeading", "sectionId": "section-2024-jslk-writing-application", "text": "第一节 (满分15分)" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-writing-application" },
      { "type": "answerBox", "writingTaskId": "writing-2024-jslk-application", "label": "Welcome to Join the English Writing Competition" },
      { "type": "sectionHeading", "sectionId": "section-2024-jslk-writing-continuation", "text": "第二节 (满分25分)" },
      { "type": "instruction", "text": "阅读下面材料，根据其内容和所给段落开头语续写两段，使之构成一篇完整的短文。" },
      { "type": "group", "groupId": "group-2024-jslk-writing-continuation" },
      { "type": "answerBox", "writingTaskId": "writing-2024-jslk-continuation", "label": "续写答题区" }
    ],

